 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Tips and obligation",
   "texto": [
    "**Bør + infinitivo** gives a tip: **Du bør følge rådet** («You should follow the advice.»). **Må + infinitivo** expresses a clearer obligation: **Du må bestille time** («You have to make an appointment.»). After both manners **å** is not used."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Information on medicinal products",
   "texto": [
    "**Pakningsvedlegg** is the package leaflet; **bivirkning** is an unwanted effect. If you don't understand the instructions, you can ask them to explain. This lesson teaches phrases to ask; the specific indications depend on the doctor or the package leaflet."
   ]
  },
